{"id":"fe6e46b8595a7907","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/625_双向时态逻辑.md","title":"625 双向时态逻辑","display":"625_双向时态逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>。原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad\\bot,\\quad\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\\operatorname{next},\\quad\\operatorname{prev},\\quad\\operatorname{until},\\quad\\operatorname{since}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\quad\\bot,\\quad\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\\operatorname{next},\\quad\\operatorname{prev},\\quad\\operatorname{until},\\quad\\operatorname{since}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"XA=\\operatorname{next}(A),\\quad YA=\\operatorname{prev}(A),\\quad A\\,U\\,B=\\operatorname{until}(A,B),\\quad A\\,S\\,B=\\operatorname{since}(A,B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[XA=\\operatorname{next}(A),\\quad YA=\\operatorname{prev}(A),\\quad A\\,U\\,B=\\operatorname{until}(A,B),\\quad A\\,S\\,B=\\operatorname{since}(A,B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=(\\neg A\\to B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\\quad\nFA=\\top\\,U\\,A,\\quad\nPA=\\top\\,S\\,A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=(\\neg A\\to B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\\quad\nFA=\\top\\,U\\,A,\\quad\nPA=\\top\\,S\\,A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"XA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\">\\(XA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"YA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\">\\(YA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\,U\\,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\">\\(A\\,U\\,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\,S\\,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\">\\(A\\,S\\,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元\">3. 自由变元</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{625}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{625}\\)</span> 定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{625}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{625}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{625}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{625}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{625}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{625}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{625}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{625}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{625}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{625}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{625}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{625}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{625}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{625}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{625}(XA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{625}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{625}(XA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{625}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{625}(YA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{625}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{625}(YA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{625}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{625}(A\\,U\\,B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{625}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{625}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{625}(A\\,U\\,B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{625}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{625}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{625}(A\\,S\\,B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{625}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{625}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{625}(A\\,S\\,B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{625}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{625}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{625}(A)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{625}(A)=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-命题替换\">4. 命题替换</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{625}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{625}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{625}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{625}\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{625}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{625}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\)</span>，其中扩张满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(XA)=X\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(XA)=X\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(YA)=Y\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(YA)=Y\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\,U\\,B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\,U\\,\\widehat\\sigma(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\,U\\,B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\,U\\,\\widehat\\sigma(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\,S\\,B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\,S\\,\\widehat\\sigma(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\,S\\,B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\,S\\,\\widehat\\sigma(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,625}B\">\\(A\\equiv_{\\alpha,625}B\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=B\">\\(A=B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-公理集合\">5. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理三族为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{625}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{625}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{625}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{625}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{625}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{625}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{625}=\\{\\bot\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{625}=\\{\\bot\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>时态公理族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{XK}^{625}=\\{X(A\\to B)\\to(XA\\to XB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{XK}^{625}=\\{X(A\\to B)\\to(XA\\to XB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{YK}^{625}=\\{Y(A\\to B)\\to(YA\\to YB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{YK}^{625}=\\{Y(A\\to B)\\to(YA\\to YB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{XY}^{625}=\\{A\\to XY A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{XY}^{625}=\\{A\\to XY A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{YX}^{625}=\\{A\\to YX A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{YX}^{625}=\\{A\\to YX A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{UFix}^{625}=\\{(A\\,U\\,B)\\leftrightarrow(B\\lor(A\\land X(A\\,U\\,B))):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{UFix}^{625}=\\{(A\\,U\\,B)\\leftrightarrow(B\\lor(A\\land X(A\\,U\\,B))):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{SFix}^{625}=\\{(A\\,S\\,B)\\leftrightarrow(B\\lor(A\\land Y(A\\,S\\,B))):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{SFix}^{625}=\\{(A\\,S\\,B)\\leftrightarrow(B\\lor(A\\land Y(A\\,S\\,B))):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{625}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{625}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{625}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{625}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{625}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{XK}^{625}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{YK}^{625}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{XY}^{625}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{YX}^{625}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{UFix}^{625}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SFix}^{625}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{625}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{625}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{625}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{625}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{625}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{XK}^{625}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{YK}^{625}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{XY}^{625}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{YX}^{625}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{UFix}^{625}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{SFix}^{625}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则关系\">6. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{625}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{625}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecX}^{625}=\\{((A),XA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecX}^{625}=\\{((A),XA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecY}^{625}=\\{((A),YA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecY}^{625}=\\{((A),YA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{IndU}^{625}=\\{((C\\to(B\\lor(A\\land XC))),C\\to(A\\,U\\,B)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{IndU}^{625}=\\{((C\\to(B\\lor(A\\land XC))),C\\to(A\\,U\\,B)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{IndS}^{625}=\\{((C\\to(B\\lor(A\\land YC))),C\\to(A\\,S\\,B)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{IndS}^{625}=\\{((C\\to(B\\lor(A\\land YC))),C\\to(A\\,S\\,B)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{625}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{625}\\)</span> 为五个规则关系的并。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\)</span>。证明是非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\)</span>。每行满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{625}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{625}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=A_j\\to A_i\">\\(A_k=A_j\\to A_i\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecX}^{625}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecX}^{625}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecY}^{625}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecY}^{625}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{IndU}^{625}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{IndU}^{625}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{IndS}^{625}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{IndS}^{625}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{625}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{625}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 为所有满足上述条件的非空有限序列的集合。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{625}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{625}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在证明行 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Delta_i,A)\">\\((\\Delta_i,A)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma\">\\(\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{625}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{625}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{625}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{625}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-双向时间语义\">9. 双向时间语义</h1>\n<p>双向时间模型为四元组</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=(T,\\operatorname{next},\\operatorname{prev},V)\\in\\mathsf{BiTimeMod}_{625},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M=(T,\\operatorname{next},\\operatorname{prev},V)\\in\\mathsf{BiTimeMod}_{625},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(T\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{next}:T\\to T\">\\(\\operatorname{next}:T\\to T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{prev}:T\\to T\">\\(\\operatorname{prev}:T\\to T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(T)\">\\(V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(T)\\)</span>，并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{prev}(\\operatorname{next}(t))=t,\\quad\n\\operatorname{next}(\\operatorname{prev}(t))=t.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{prev}(\\operatorname{next}(t))=t,\\quad\n\\operatorname{next}(\\operatorname{prev}(t))=t.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个上述模型分别定义函数族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\operatorname{next}^{n})_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((\\operatorname{next}^{n})_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\operatorname{prev}^{n})_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((\\operatorname{prev}^{n})_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span>，其中对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 都有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{next}^{n},\\operatorname{prev}^{n}:T\\to T\">\\(\\operatorname{next}^{n},\\operatorname{prev}^{n}:T\\to T\\)</span>。零与后继子句对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in T\">\\(t\\in T\\)</span> 为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{next}^{0}(t)=t,\\qquad \\operatorname{prev}^{0}(t)=t,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{next}^{0}(t)=t,\\qquad \\operatorname{prev}^{0}(t)=t,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{next}^{n+1}(t)=\\operatorname{next}(\\operatorname{next}^{n}(t)),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{prev}^{n+1}(t)=\\operatorname{prev}(\\operatorname{prev}^{n}(t)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{next}^{n+1}(t)=\\operatorname{next}(\\operatorname{next}^{n}(t)),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{prev}^{n+1}(t)=\\operatorname{prev}(\\operatorname{prev}^{n}(t)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此零次幂是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 上的恒等函数，一次幂分别为模型的后继与前驱；由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的归纳，每个后继输出仍在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>。下文 U/S 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 次和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 次调用均使用这两个族；当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k&lt;n\">\\(k&lt;n\\)</span> 没有实例，条件恰要求当前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 满足后件 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\\in\\mathsf{BiTimeMod}_{625}\">\\(\\mathcal M\\in\\mathsf{BiTimeMod}_{625}\\)</span>，解释函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦-⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\to\\mathcal P(T)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦-⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}\\to\\mathcal P(T)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>递归定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\operatorname{atom}(p)⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\\quad\n⟦\\bot⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\operatorname{atom}(p)⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\\quad\n⟦\\bot⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\neg A⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M}=T\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M},\\quad\n⟦ A\\to B⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M}=(T\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup⟦ B⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\neg A⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M}=T\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M},\\quad\n⟦ A\\to B⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M}=(T\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup⟦ B⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ XA⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{t\\in T:\\operatorname{next}(t)\\in⟦ A⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ XA⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{t\\in T:\\operatorname{next}(t)\\in⟦ A⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ YA⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{t\\in T:\\operatorname{prev}(t)\\in⟦ A⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ YA⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{t\\in T:\\operatorname{prev}(t)\\in⟦ A⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ A\\,U\\,B⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{t\\in T:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \n(\\operatorname{next}^{n}(t)\\in⟦ B⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M}\n\\land\n\\forall k&lt;n\\ \\operatorname{next}^{k}(t)\\in⟦ A⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M})\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ A\\,U\\,B⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{t\\in T:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \n(\\operatorname{next}^{n}(t)\\in⟦ B⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M}\n\\land\n\\forall k&lt;n\\ \\operatorname{next}^{k}(t)\\in⟦ A⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M})\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ A\\,S\\,B⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{t\\in T:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \n(\\operatorname{prev}^{n}(t)\\in⟦ B⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M}\n\\land\n\\forall k&lt;n\\ \\operatorname{prev}^{k}(t)\\in⟦ A⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ A\\,S\\,B⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{t\\in T:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \n(\\operatorname{prev}^{n}(t)\\in⟦ B⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M}\n\\land\n\\forall k&lt;n\\ \\operatorname{prev}^{k}(t)\\in⟦ A⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足关系定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,t\\Vdash_{625}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nt\\in⟦ A⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,t\\Vdash_{625}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nt\\in⟦ A⟧_{625}^{\\mathcal M}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{625}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(T,\\operatorname{next},\\operatorname{prev},V)\\in\\mathsf{BiTimeMod}_{625}\\ \\forall t\\in T\\\n((\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,t\\Vdash_{625}B)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,t\\Vdash_{625}A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{625}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(T,\\operatorname{next},\\operatorname{prev},V)\\in\\mathsf{BiTimeMod}_{625}\\ \\forall t\\in T\\\n((\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,t\\Vdash_{625}B)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,t\\Vdash_{625}A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-目标区分\">10. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本系统的目标差异是同时含未来算子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,U\">\\(X,U\\)</span> 与过去算子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y,S\">\\(Y,S\\)</span>，并用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{XY}^{625}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{XY}^{625}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{YX}^{625}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{YX}^{625}\\)</span> 明确连接相邻未来与过去；第 9 节用互逆的前驱和后继解释这种双向时间流。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{BiTemp}_{625}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{625},\\operatorname{FV}_{625},\\operatorname{BV}_{625},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{625},\\operatorname{Sub}_{625},\\equiv_{\\alpha,625},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{625},\\mathsf{Rule}_{625},\\mathsf{Proof}_{625},\\vdash_{625},\\mathsf{Thm}_{625},\n\\mathsf{BiTimeMod}_{625},\\operatorname{next},\\operatorname{prev},⟦-⟧_{625},\\Vdash_{625},\\models_{625}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{BiTemp}_{625}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{625},\\operatorname{FV}_{625},\\operatorname{BV}_{625},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{625},\\operatorname{Sub}_{625},\\equiv_{\\alpha,625},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{625},\\mathsf{Rule}_{625},\\mathsf{Proof}_{625},\\vdash_{625},\\mathsf{Thm}_{625},\n\\mathsf{BiTimeMod}_{625},\\operatorname{next},\\operatorname{prev},⟦-⟧_{625},\\Vdash_{625},\\models_{625}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统由双向时态句法、公理、规则、证明关系以及双向时间流语义共同组成。</p>\n<p>不在本条目中断言可靠性、完备性或时间流表示定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元","text":"3. 自由变元","level":1},{"id":"4.-命题替换","text":"4. 命题替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理集合","text":"5. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则关系","text":"6. 推理规则关系","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-双向时间语义","text":"9. 双向时间语义","level":1},{"id":"10.-目标区分","text":"10. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad\\bot,\\quad\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\\operatorname{next},\\quad\\operatorname{prev},\\quad\\operatorname{until},\\quad\\operatorname{since}.","display":true},{"tex":"XA=\\operatorname{next}(A),\\quad YA=\\operatorname{prev}(A),\\quad A\\,U\\,B=\\operatorname{until}(A,B),\\quad A\\,S\\,B=\\operatorname{since}(A,B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=(\\neg A\\to B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\\quad\nFA=\\top\\,U\\,A,\\quad\nPA=\\top\\,S\\,A.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}","display":false},{"tex":"XA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}","display":false},{"tex":"YA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{625}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf